"Sin vista previa": "No preview",
"Entra en el cálculo de la masa total, el centro de gravedad y la inercia; al exportar se guarda en el proyecto (las etapas se recalculan solas).": "It enters the total mass, centre of gravity and inertia calculation; on export it is saved in the project (the stages recalculate by themselves).",
"Generando la vista previa automática (unos segundos)…": "Generating the automatic preview (a few seconds)…",
"Vista previa automática: es la que llevará el coche si no subes una imagen.": "Automatic preview: it is the one the car will carry if you do not upload an image.",
"Imagen subida por ti.": "Image uploaded by you.",
"Imagen elegida (se aplica al guardar).": "Chosen image (applied on save).",
"Generar vista previa": "Generate preview",
